<div id="982ca9e0"><div class="gDIpMKG1V3TER0F1R9QU zdJlj3sb9me5el2MV92T"><div class="IxizTcDR3u2KZs4JQ2U5"><h2 class="NtTA6NGb1kkh2gQmC21l"></h2></div><ul class="GkS0HrjTXJgaqAcFFQcz"><li><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8 qkqgbJDFpjA4mNFhjKvG ZHXK4_2sRaJrBBtZXn7u"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/5e77750371aa4dc98e3c1f99d494009a/kristiania_kampanje_2024_30.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/5e77750371aa4dc98e3c1f99d494009a/kristiania_kampanje_2024_30.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/5e77750371aa4dc98e3c1f99d494009a/kristiania_kampanje_2024_30.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/5e77750371aa4dc98e3c1f99d494009a/kristiania_kampanje_2024_30.jpg?width=500" alt="Student standing in front of the lockers in Kirkegata" style="object-position:40% 33%" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Five reasons to go on a student exchange</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><ol class="Richtext__ol">
<li><strong>Experience other cultures:</strong> An exchange gives you the opportunity to experience a new culture.<br><br></li>
<li><strong>Personal growth:</strong> Living in another country challenges you to become more independent, adaptable, and confident.<br><br></li>
<li><strong>Academic development:</strong> You gain access to unique study opportunities that can enrich your academic competence<br><br></li>
<li><strong>Make friends from around the world:</strong> You get the chance to connect with students from all over the world and create future collaboration opportunities.<br><br></li>
<li><strong>Learn a language:</strong> Being surrounded by a foreign language allows you to improve your language skills.<br><br><strong>And that's not all:</strong> Several studies show that a student exchange has a positive effect on future job opportunities. Not only do you gain international experience, but you also show employers that you are curious, flexible, and independent!</li>
</ol></div></div></div></div></div></section></li></ul></div><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['982ca9e0-json'] = {"title":null,"overrideItemsBackground":true,"backgroundVariant":"dark","items":[{"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/5e77750371aa4dc98e3c1f99d494009a/kristiania_kampanje_2024_30.jpg","alt":"Student standing in front of the lockers in Kirkegata","focalPoint":{"x":0.4,"y":0.33},"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Five reasons to go on a student exchange","htmlText":{"value":"<ol class=\"Richtext__ol\">\n<li><strong>Experience other cultures:</strong> An exchange gives you the opportunity to experience a new culture.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><strong>Personal growth:</strong> Living in another country challenges you to become more independent, adaptable, and confident.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><strong>Academic development:</strong> You gain access to unique study opportunities that can enrich your academic competence<br /><br /></li>\n<li><strong>Make friends from around the world:</strong> You get the chance to connect with students from all over the world and create future collaboration opportunities.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><strong>Learn a language:</strong> Being surrounded by a foreign language allows you to improve your language skills.<br /><br /><strong>And that's not all:</strong> Several studies show that a student exchange has a positive effect on future job opportunities. Not only do you gain international experience, but you also show employers that you are curious, flexible, and independent!</li>\n</ol>"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"}]};</script></div>
